            </note>
            <note corresp="#d146-f2" n="2" xml:id="d146-f2-content">
                <p> NSC 52/2, September 26, not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d146-f3" n="3" xml:id="d146-f3-content">
                <p>Of July 5, <ref target="#pg349">p. 349</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d146-f4" n="4" xml:id="d146-f4-content">
                <p>This report did not receive the formal approval or disapproval of President
                    Truman. It remained the subject of White House consideration until superseded by
                    studies undertaken by the National Security Council in, 1950.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
